WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.435
Yay summer!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.312
Yay!

00:00:07.813 --> 00:00:08.355
Woo!

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:09.523
[Laughing]

00:00:10.023 --> 00:00:11.441
Ohhh

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:12.442
Yeah!!

00:00:15.362 --> 00:00:16.154
[Laughing]

00:00:17.197 --> 00:00:19.199
Back to school already?

00:00:19.324 --> 00:00:21.952
Too bad we can't have Summer
forever.

00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:25.038
There it is our new school

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.790
New classrooms.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.208
New subjects.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:30.710
I feel a stomach ache coming on.

00:00:32.712 --> 00:00:35.465
There's a special test you can
take, if you pass it

00:00:35.465 --> 00:00:38.051
you never have to return to
school again.

00:00:38.301 --> 00:00:39.302
Yay!

00:00:39.803 --> 00:00:41.930
This isn't going to end well.

00:00:43.515 --> 00:00:45.934
Today we are studying the
television.

00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:46.768
Oooo

00:00:47.269 --> 00:00:49.271
I told you this teaching stuff
was a piece of cake.

00:00:49.604 --> 00:00:51.439
it's easy when you make it all
up.

00:00:52.148 --> 00:00:54.276
Potato yum

00:00:54.693 --> 00:00:55.443
Huh?

00:00:55.443 --> 00:00:57.279
I think you mean potassium.

00:00:59.573 --> 00:01:00.365
Ah!

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.492
Is that going to be on the test?

00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:04.953
It takes a lot of courage

00:01:04.953 --> 00:01:06.955
to admit when you're in over
your head.

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.502
We students might not always
give you teachers

00:01:12.502 --> 00:01:15.505
enough appreciation but in my
eyes you're all heroes.

00:01:16.673 --> 00:01:18.091
Here you go Ms. Offmar.

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.135
This should get you through the
next few months.

00:01:22.762 --> 00:01:24.764
Hey Snoopy, page thirty-four

